   {
      "id": "L-S1E01-C03",
      "title": "Hope and Landon talk about the school at the office",
      "description": "Hope and Landon talk about the school with Alaric",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "explanation",
        "comfort"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,


       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
          },
          "text": "So, what are you?"
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
         },
         "text": "I should get to class."
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "No. No. Sorry. I don't mean to be a dick but, I don't know you, and though the image of you whammying a priest is still fresh, I need you here. Just tell me what all that was in the church last night?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "What do you think it was?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T05",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Well, as best as I can reason, either I've lost my mind or werewolves are real.Th-This is beyond insane. How is that even possible?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "It's a long story, involving an ancient, vengeful witch and a bloodline curse. We cover all that in Origins of the Species, grade six."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T07",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "In sixth grade at my school, we learned the state capitals."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C03-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "We teach that too."
      }
      
    ]
  },

  "short": {
    "turns": [
