{
      "id": "L-S1E01-C04",
      "title": "Hope and Landon talk about Rafael at the office",
      "description": "Hope and Landon talk about Rafael with Alaric",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "explanation",
        "comfort"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,


       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
          },
          "text": "Why would you ask me that?"
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
         },
         "text": "The werewolf gene lies dormant until the carrier takes a human life. If Rafael triggered his curse, it's... because he ed someone. And we don't accept coldblooded ers into our program."
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": " He's not a er."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "We're not trying..."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T05",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "He's not... a er"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "Well, I know a little bit about his background. Neglectful birth parents. Orphaned in adolescence. Six foster homes in seven years. Prone to fits of anger."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T07",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Yeah, you could just as easily be reading my file. That's what it's like out there for people like him and me."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Landon, I know this is a lot to take in right now, but we're only trying to help. I've been going here since I was seven. This is a safe place for people like Rafael. It's a home."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T09",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "But if we take him in, we need to make sure that he is not a threat."
      },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T10",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "His girlfriend... Cassie. Last month he was driving, there was a storm, he took a turn too fast. And then he started acting out. At first I thought it was just grief. And then maybe... maybe drugs or something. And then he threw a 200 pound lawnmower 50 feet across the yard. That was when our foster parents called in the priest. I guess they thought he was possessed by the devil."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T11",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Alaric",
          "version": "Alaric"
        },
        "text": "It's normal. Thank you for that, Landon. Hope"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Everything's gonna be okay. I promise. We're ready."
      }
    ]
  },

  "short": {
    "turns": [
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C04-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Everything's gonna be okay. I promise. We're ready."
      }
    ]
  }
