         {
          "id": "L-S1E01-C10-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "Can I show you something? Earlier, you mentioned the jock that had messed with you the day that we danced."
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E01-C10-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
         },
         "text": "That's the guy. You can just dial up one of my memories like that?"
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C10-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "It's not your memory. It's mine."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C10-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "You did that for me?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C10-T05",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "He had it coming. Um, we shouldn't be in here after curfew. We should get you back before anyone knows that you're gone."
      }
      
  
    
    
    ]
