      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C11-T07",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Probably not. No."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E01-C11-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Well, in that case..."
